# Future benchmark / diagnostic output is disposable and ignored by default.
# EXCEPTION: the frozen baseline results (v1/v2 runs, the phase-2 diagnostic runs cited in docs/) were added to Git explicitly with
# `git add -f`; tracked files stay tracked regardless of this rule. Verify them with `python3 scripts/verify_baseline_hashes.py`.
backend/artifacts/

